 "title": "Chapter 3",
 "content": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><body><div class=\"os-eob os-solutions-container\" data-type=\"composite-page\" data-uuid-key=\".solutions3\" id=\"composite-page-27\" data-book-content=\"true\"><h2 data-type=\"document-title\" data-rex-keep=\"true\">\n    <span class=\"os-text\">Chapter 3</span>\n  </h2>\n  <div class=\"os-solution-area\"><h3 data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Checkpoint</span>\n</h3>\n\n  <div data-type=\"solution\" id=\"fs-id1169738923828-solution\"><a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea.xhtml#fs-id1169738923828\" aria-label=\"Go to 3.11\" data-page-slug=\"3-3-differentiation-rules\" data-page-uuid=\"f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169738923828\">3.11</a><span class=\"os-divider\"> </span>\n<div class=\"os-solution-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738853102\">0</p>\n</div>\n</div><div data-type=\"solution\" id=\"fs-id1169736611688-solution\"><a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea.xhtml#fs-id1169736611688\" aria-label=\"Go to 3.12\" data-page-slug=\"3-3-differentiation-rules\" data-page-uuid=\"f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169736611688\">3.12</a><span class=\"os-divider\"> </span>\n<div class=\"os-solution-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169739000891\">\n  <span class=\"os-math-in-para\"><math display=\"inline\">\n    <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n        <mrow>\n          <mn>4</mn>\n          <msup>\n            <mi>x</mi>\n            <mn>3</mn>\n          </msup>\n        </mrow>\n      </mrow>\n      </semantics>\n  </math></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"os-solution-area\"><h3 data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Section 3.3 Exercises</span>\n</h3>\n\n  <div data-type=\"solution\" id=\"fs-id1169739293680-solution\"><a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea.xhtml#fs-id1169739293680\" aria-label=\"Go to 107\" data-page-slug=\"3-3-differentiation-rules\" data-page-uuid=\"f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169739293680\">107</a><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-solution-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169739293719\">\n  <span class=\"os-math-in-para\"><math display=\"inline\">\n    <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n        <mrow>\n          <msup>\n            <mi>f</mi>\n            <mo>′</mo>\n          </msup>\n          <mrow>\n            <mo>(</mo>\n            <mi>x</mi>\n            <mo>)</mo>\n          </mrow>\n          <mo>=</mo>\n          <mn>15</mn>\n          <msup>\n            <mi>x</mi>\n            <mn>2</mn>\n          </msup>\n          <mo>−</mo>\n          <mn>1</mn>\n        </mrow>\n      </mrow>\n      </semantics>\n  </math></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div data-type=\"solution\" id=\"fs-id1169736595965-solution\"><a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea.xhtml#fs-id1169736595965\" aria-label=\"Go to 109\" data-page-slug=\"3-3-differentiation-rules\" data-page-uuid=\"f1a25413-3af2-4f97-8aac-dd75a16c8aea\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169736595965\">109</a><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-solution-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169736596010\">\n  <span class=\"os-math-in-para\"><math display=\"inline\">\n    <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n        <mrow>\n          <msup>\n            <mi>f</mi>\n            <mo>′</mo>\n          </msup>\n          <mrow>\n            <mo>(</mo>\n            <mi>x</mi>\n            <mo>)</mo>\n          </mrow>\n          <mo>=</mo>\n          <mn>32</mn>\n          <msup>\n            <mi>x</mi>\n            <mn>3</mn>\n          </msup>\n          <mo>+</mo>\n          <mn>18</mn>\n          <mi>x</mi>\n        </mrow>\n      </mrow>\n      </semantics>\n  </math></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"os-solution-area\"><h3 data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Review Exercises</span>\n</h3>\n\n  <div data-type=\"solution\" id=\"fs-id1169738040717-solution\"><a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:7a176c30-a757-5743-bf03-07880edea272.xhtml#fs-id1169738040717\" aria-label=\"Go to 367\" data-page-slug=\"3-review-exercises\" data-page-uuid=\"7a176c30-a757-5743-bf03-07880edea272\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169738040717\">367</a><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-solution-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738040727\">False.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div data-type=\"solution\" id=\"fs-id1169738040749-solution\"><a class=\"os-number\" href=\"./8b89d172-2927-466f-8661-01abc7ccdba4@8dbc2ce:7a176c30-a757-5743-bf03-07880edea272.xhtml#fs-id1169738040749\" aria-label=\"Go to 369\" data-page-slug=\"3-review-exercises\" data-page-uuid=\"7a176c30-a757-5743-bf03-07880edea272\" data-page-fragment=\"fs-id1169738040749\">369</a><span class=\"os-divider\">. </span>\n<div class=\"os-solution-container\">\n<p id=\"fs-id1169738040759\">False</p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
